\"><h2 id=\"Overview\">Overview</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=1978_Allsvenskan&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Overview\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>The league was contested by 14 teams, with <a href=\"/wiki/%C3%96sters_IF\" title=\"Östers IF\">Östers IF</a> winning the championship.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"League_table\">League table</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=1978_Allsvenskan&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: League table\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r1011077906\">.mw-parser-output .sports-table-notes{font-size:90%;margin-bottom:0.5em}</style>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th scope=\"col\" width=\"28\"><abbr title=\"Position\">Pos</abbr>\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" width=\"190\">Team\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" width=\"28\"><abbr title=\"Played\">Pld</abbr>\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" width=\"28\"><abbr title=\"Won\">W</abbr>\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" width=\"28\"><abbr title=\"Drawn\">D</abbr>\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" width=\"28\"><abbr title=\"Lost\">L</abbr>\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" width=\"28\"><abbr title=\"Goals for\">GF</abbr>\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" width=\"28\"><abbr title=\"Goals against\">GA</abbr>\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" width=\"28\"><abbr title=\"Goal difference\">GD</abbr>\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" width=\"28\"><abbr title=\"Points\">Pts</abbr>\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">Qualification or relegation\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;font-weight: normal;background-color:#BBF3BB;color:black;\">1\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align: left; white-space:nowrap;font-weight: normal;background-color:#BBF3B